WEBVTT

00:07:27.542 --> 00:07:30.750
na kitabu alichotokea kukipenda zaidi, 
kamusi.

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:33.351
Kwa baadhi ya siku,

00:07:33.375 --> 00:07:37.167
tulikaa kimya kwa masaa,
wote wawili tukisoma.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:39.934
Na siku nyingine,

00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:43.476
tulisoma pamoja,
tulisoma mashairi.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:47.393
tulianza kwa kusoma haikus,
mamia ya haikus,

00:07:47.417 --> 00:07:50.309
ni kito rahisi na danganyifu.

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:53.143
Na ningemuuliza,
"Nishirikishe haiku zako unazozipenda".

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:56.226
Na baadhi yake ni za kufurahisha sana.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.101
Kuna hii ya Issa:

00:07:58.125 --> 00:08:01.833
"Usijali, buibui,
ninaweka nyumba kikawaida."